From 5052f40c7b9d1938aba9fa11eb71203753e50cfc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gaurav-paul9 <paulgaurav9@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 07:04:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/11] libcameraservice: Add camera extension infrastructure
 and OEM prerequisites

Aligns camera extension and vendor-tag injection support with A17 Evolution X:
- Android.bp: Wire CAMERA_PACKAGE_NAME and needs_client_info_lib soong configs in cameraserver and libcameraservice
- SessionConfigurationUtils: Allow privileged apps to bypass rounding for Y8 and Y16 stream formats
- CameraDeviceClient: Bypass isSensorPixelModeConsistent for privileged clients and add getCaptureRequestU8OverridesExt hook
- CameraProviderExtension: Add default weak implementation of getCaptureRequestU8OverridesExt
- Camera3Device: Signal mRequestSignal in flush() for result drain optimization
- CameraServiceExtFactory: Latch ensureLoaded() to load extension at most once and reduce log spam
